    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DashFire is an online multiplayer arena-style shooter, inspired by Quake and Unreal Tournament. Face off against 7 of your friends in this fast-paced first-person shooter experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players compete in two unique maps, collecting a variety of weapons and other various pickups to dominate the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Player Lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Weapon Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Unique Maps</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DashFire is an online multiplayer arena-style shooter, inspired by Quake and Unreal Tournament. Face off against 7 of your friends in this fast-paced first-person shooter experience! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 8 players compete in two unique maps, collecting a variety of weapons and other various pickups to dominate the competition!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Player Lobbies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Server browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Unique Weapon Types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Unique Maps</p></li></ul>",
